OL,3,GNEWSAAncient forest recommended for
OL,4,Aglobal Unesco status
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharnwood Forest Geopark has been
OL,7,Fshortlisted to be given special
OL,8,Frecognition by Unesco.
OL,10,FThe ancient landscape in Leicestershire
OL,11,Fhas taken shape over millions of years
OL,12,Fand is widely recognised for its rich
OL,13,Fgeology.
OL,15,FAn application to become a Unesco
OL,16,FGlobal Geopark, led by The National
OL,17,FForest, was submitted last year and
OL,18,Fevaluators visited the area - which
OL,19,Fincludes Bradgate Park, Beacon Hill,
OL,20,FGrace Dieu Priory, Hill Hole, Billa
OL,21,FBarra and Sandham Bridge - in August.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
